        "cooked": "<p>It doesn't work.</p><blockquote><p>You may destroy this card to put that card back in play.</p></blockquote><p>The card is destroyed to trigger the effect.</p><p>Cards that trigger on destruction cannot be destroyed again before they leave play.</p><p>Contrast with Adepts \"Use a power then destroy this card\" which sticks around and can be used multiple times before it is destrpoyed.</p><p>Once Sustained Influence is destroyed to bring the card back, it cannot be triggered again until it enters play as a new card.</p>",
